#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# machine_precision

#% text
# `machine_precision` is the precision of machine numbers, `53 log10(2)` = 15.9546 digits.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# `n(machine_precision, d)` gives `d` digits of it.

#% item
# It is a symbolic expression, not a machine number.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
machine_precision
#% output
#= 15.954589770191003

#% cell
n(machine_precision, 30)
#% output
#= 15.954589770191003

#% cell
round(machine_precision)
#% output
#= 16

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `precision`, `accuracy`
